<title>FRANCE: GENERALE DES EAUX TRADES HIGHER ON DEBT NEWS.</title>
<headline>GENERALE DES EAUX TRADES HIGHER ON DEBT NEWS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Generale des Eaux were trading higher in an easier market as the company said that 99.2 percent of a bond had been converted early, cutting debt by five billion francs.</p>
<p>At 0955 GMT, Generale was up 1.46 percent at 766 francs while the index of blue-chip shares was down 0.29 percent.</p>
<p>Generale said it was maintaining its goal of cutting debt to 32 billion at the end of 1997 from 45 billion in 1996.</p>
</text>
